  "ingredients": [
    "1/4 cup pumpkin puree",
    "2 tablespoon butter",
    "1 cup unsweetened carton coconut milk",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 teaspoon pumpkin pie spice",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "2 cup brewed coffee (strong, freshly brewed)",
    "15 drop liquid stevia",
    "2 tablespoon heavy whipping cream"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "In a pot over medium-low heat, add in the pumpkin, butter, coconut milk, vanilla, and spices.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-pie-spice-latte/#wprm-recipe-51463-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/img_5958.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the pumpkin mixture is coming together, brew some strong coffee. I love using my Keurig for this.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-pie-spice-latte/#wprm-recipe-51463-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/img_5965.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the pumpkin mixture has warmed up and is beginning to bubble slightly, mix it.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-pie-spice-latte/#wprm-recipe-51463-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/img_5971.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in the coffee.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-pie-spice-latte/#wprm-recipe-51463-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/img_5979.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the stevia and heavy cream. Use an immersion blender to thoroughly combine the mixture while still on the stovetop.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-pie-spice-latte/#wprm-recipe-51463-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/img_59891.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour up, topping with additional whipped cream and a sprinkle of cinnamon, if you like. Sit back, relax, and enjoy the morning!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-pie-spice-latte/#wprm-recipe-51463-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
